      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)A custom brew remembers each ingredient in the order it enters the Witch's Cauldron.[#]()",
      "title": "Brew Reagents",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Drop ordinary brew ingredients into heated water; ingredients marked **sneak-stir** must be added by sneaking and right-clicking the cauldron, so they do not feed a different cauldron recipe.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Ingredients marked **drop or sneak-stir** accept either gesture.[#]() [#](53341a)The notes below are drawn from the live brew registry. **Level** is the capacity an effect consumes.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)**Power** is altar power charged when the brew is bottled, bucketed, or released by ritual.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
